  "내용": {
   "null_rate": 0.0,
   "unique": 65,
   "top": {
    "Eco-friendly park at the foot of Waryong Reservoir. Yongdu Park!Yongdu Park is a park for relaxation, where hikers and citizens can take a good rest. Hinoki cypress trees, forest bathing area, grass square, exercise area, trail, and etc satisfy the health needs of the hikers and citizens, establishing as the perfect place for rest and leisure.": 2,
    "A loaf of bread is better than the song of many birds. Fresh sashimi is a must-eat for the Sacheon tourists!Samcheonpo Fish Market is another name for Samcheonpo Western Market. At this market, like any other traditional markets, various vegetables and fruits from the regional farms, and live fish, shellfish, and dried fish can be purchased.": 2,
    "Sunjin-ri Fort is most beautiful when its cherry blossoms fully bloom.Sunjin-ri Fort in Sacheon is Japanese-style Fort, built by Japanese army during Japanese invasion of Korea in 1592. Thats why some people refer to it as Sunjin-ri Japanese Fort. Now you can only identify traces of the Fort on a shallow-sloping hill. Visitors will be welcomed with full blown cherry blossoms around the Fort in spring, as if it tries to cover its wound with the flower./ Sunjin-ri Fort is at its zenith during spring, when cherry blossoms are in full bloom.": 2,
    "Sacheon Bay Coastal Road connects Sacheon Regular Industrial Complex to Namyang-dong Coastal Road.This is an eco-friendly and pleasant road, where you can enjoy beautiful landscape. The road has a local characteristic and signification. At Ryonghyeon-myeon Geummun Coast, you will hear childrens joyful laughter coming out of gatbul-madang (mudflat plaza) and chehum-madang (experience plaza). Also, at the coast, there is mudflat viewing facility and windmills that make you feel as if you are in a different country. In the offshore, there is a raft-type mudflat trail that moves up and down depending on tides, where you can enjoy the sea at a closest distance, and be able to observe and experience mudflats.": 2,
    "Yongso Recreation Center is a perfect place for summer vacation.A clean and non-deep water of the valley attracts family vacationers with children. Many people visit the place to escape the heat, or to camp. You wont regret choosing Yongso Recreation Center and Yongso Valley for your summer vacation. / Yongso Valley is a summer vacation spot, so prepare for fun in the water!": 2,
    "A painting on the calm surface of water!Daebangjin Port is an artificial port system built to protect the coast from Japanese pirates. It was a military base designed in a way that the inside of the port was not visible from the outside. The dark shadow of old hackberry trees over the turquoise water features landscape painting scenery.": 1,
    "Located at the entrance of ChangseonSamcheonpo bridge, Samcheonpo bridge Park runs regional specialty shops, outdoor stage, and tourist information center. This is where the marina for The Hallyeo waterway (name of a supersize cruise ship) is, which enables 100,000 tourists to visit per year.": 1,
    "The view of the seashore, blue waves, and coastlines is spectacular on Silannakjo coastal road, especially with the sunset glow.": 1,
    "Shape of an elephant with its trunk dipped in the water for a drink! Elephant Rock at Namildae.A natural cave was formed between trunk and body of the elephant shape, where seashells, clamshells, and sand grains gets piled up by waves over a long period of time.": 1,
    "Namildae beach in Hyangchon-dong, 3.5km away from the city center, is referred as the best scenic spot in the Southern land. The island was named by a scholar in late Silla dynasty, Choe Chiwon, deeply mesmerized by its scenery.": 1
   },
