  "부제목": {
   "null_rate": 0.8857,
   "unique": 8,
   "top": {
    "First, enjoy the peace at the foot of Mt. Waryong, second, taste the fresh seafood at the fish market, and lastly, head to Samcheonpo great Bridge for scenery. Marvelous feature of Samcheonpo bridge and the clear view of the sea welcome you. ": 1,
    "Come to Shinsu Island, and the beautiful sea is all yours! Get started with Namildae’s extraordinary scenery, and then appreciate the nature’s fine beauty at one of ‘Korea’s 10 best treasure islands’, Sinsu Island. ": 1,
    "How about a trip to High-Tech Aerospace Science Museum for developing dreams and imaginative powers of children? Splendid view of Sacheon Bay’s coastal roads awaits you, too. Officially opened to the public from this year. ": 1,
    "After you heal yourself from beautiful woods and valley, you can enjoy fresh live fish sashimi while viewing the sea in Samcheonpo fishing trip. You will feel energized and refreshed after having some fresh sashimi, and driving a long stretch of coastal road. ": 1,
    "우리나라를 대표하는 사찰 중 한 곳인 다솔사! 유구한 역사를 가진 다솔사의 고즈넉한 산사에서 과거로의 여행에 젖어보고 사천 녹차 단지에 들러 녹차향을 즐겨보시기 바랍니다.": 1,
    "Bito Island has a legend of “Mr. Rabbit and the Dragon King”. It is an island that looks like a black pearl, where mudflats live and breathe. If you want to witness the opening of the sea as in the story of Moses, please visit the island at low tide": 1,
    "Sacheon is a beautiful place that is blessed with natural beauty and harmonious people. You can follow the trails of Poet Park Jaesam in the greenness of Ryongso Valley, Jinbugye Forest, Noshin Park. Sacheoneupsong (fort) has gorgeous moonlight. How about taking a break, and getting yourself some air by walking along Sacheoneupsong course?": 1,
    "Mt. Waryong reaches its maximum beauty when royal azaleas are fully bloomed in May. Take an opportunity to participate in ‘Mt. Waryong Flying Dragon Festival’ that starts in beginning of May, and fully enjoy the mountain’s beauty.": 1
